# Trivy waivers for the CD image-scan gate (.github/workflows/cd.yml, 14.8).
#
# EVERY entry MUST carry, in its comment:
#   1. why shipping with it is acceptable (not reachable/exploitable here,
#      no fixed version released yet, mitigation in place, …), and
#   2. a review-by date — entries are time-boxed debt, not permanent
#      exceptions. Remove the entry as soon as the fixed version ships.
#
# This legacy .trivyignore format supports ONLY full-line comments — an inline
# comment appended to a CVE line would break the ignore. Put the reason on the
# comment line(s) ABOVE the entry and keep the CVE line bare:
#
#   # <reason> — review by YYYY-MM-DD
#   CVE-2026-XXXXX
#
# (no waivers currently)
